msgid "Photograph the result sheet on the wall"
msgstr "Dauki hoton takardar sakamako a bango"

msgid ""
"We compare it with IReV. Two independent photos are needed to flag a "
"mismatch."
msgstr ""
"Za mu kwatanta shi da IReV. Ana bukatar hotuna biyu daga mutane daban-daban "
"kafin a ce bai yi daidai ba."

msgid "Open camera"
msgstr "Bude kyamara"

