msgstr "Duba binciken sakamakon rumfarka"

msgid "Wall sheet vs IReV, with reasons."
msgstr "Takardar bango da IReV, tare da dalilai."

msgid "View"
msgstr "Duba"

msgid "Make sure you're registered"
msgstr "Tabbatar ka yi rajista"

msgid ""
"Pre-register online, then finish in person. Only on cvr.inecnigeria.org."
msgstr ""
"Fara rajista a yanar gizo, sannan ka kammala da kanka. A cvr.inecnigeria.org"
" kadai."

msgid "How to register"
msgstr "Yadda ake rajista"

msgid "Collect your PVC"
msgstr "Karbi katin PVC dinka"

msgid "In person only. Only voters with a PVC can vote."
msgstr "Da kanka kadai. Masu PVC ne kadai za su iya zabe."

msgid "Where and how"
msgstr "Ina da yaya"

msgid "Turn on alerts"
msgstr "Kunna sanarwa"

msgid "Get an SMS if your unit moves or a result is checked."
msgstr "Za ka sami SMS idan rumfarka ta koma ko an duba sakamako."

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Kunna"

msgid "Heard something? Check it before you forward it"
msgstr "Ka ji wani abu? Duba shi kafin ka tura shi"

msgid "Forwards are not confirmation."
msgstr "Turawa ba tabbaci ba ne."

msgid "Check a rumour"
msgstr "Duba jita-jita"

