msgstr "Barka da safiya"

msgid "Good afternoon"
msgstr "Barka da rana"

msgid "Good evening"
msgstr "Barka da yamma"

msgid "We couldn't find that code. Check your voter's card."
msgstr "Ba mu sami wannan lambar ba. Duba katin zabenka."

#, python-format
msgid "Saved. %(code)s is now your polling unit."
msgstr "An ajiye. %(code)s ce rumfar zabenka yanzu."

msgid "Too many reports. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Rahotanni sun yi yawa. Sake gwadawa bayan 'yan mintuna."

msgid "SAVED"
msgstr "AN AJIYE"

msgid "SENT"
msgstr "AN TURA"

msgid "READING"
msgstr "ANA KARANTAWA"

msgid "COMPARED"
msgstr "AN KWATANTA"

msgid "RESULT"
msgstr "SAKAMAKO"

msgid "Rumour you checked"
msgstr "Jita-jitar da ka duba"

msgid "Alert sent to your phone"
msgstr "An tura sanarwa zuwa wayarka"

msgid "REPORTED"
msgstr "AN RUWAITO"

#, python-format
msgid "You reported: %(what)s"
msgstr "Ka ruwaito: %(what)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Alerts on for PU %(code)s. We sent a confirmation SMS."
msgstr "An kunna sanarwa ga PU %(code)s. Mun tura SMS na tabbatarwa."

msgid "Thanks. Your report helps other voters."
msgstr "Na gode. Rahotonka yana taimaka wa sauran masu zabe."

msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Ana jira"

msgid "Matches IReV"
msgstr "Ya yi daidai da IReV"

msgid "Mismatch with IReV"
msgstr "Bai yi daidai da IReV ba"

msgid "Needs review"
msgstr "Yana bukatar dubawa"

msgid "Result cancelled"
msgstr "An soke sakamako"

msgid ""
"No result-sheet photos yet. Results appear after counting at the polling "
"unit."
msgstr ""
"Babu hoton takardar sakamako tukuna. Sakamako zai bayyana bayan kirga a "
"rumfar zabe."

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)d independent upload"
msgid_plural "%(n)d independent uploads"
msgstr[0] "hoto %(n)d mai zaman kansa"
msgstr[1] "hotuna %(n)d masu zaman kansu"

msgid ", including agents from different parties"
msgstr ", har da wakilan jam'iyyu daban-daban"

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s match the sheet on IReV."
msgstr "%(who)s sun yi daidai da takardar IReV."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(who)s agree with each other but differ from the sheet on IReV. Observers "
"have been alerted."
msgstr ""
"%(who)s sun yarda da juna amma sun bambanta da takardar IReV. An sanar da "
"masu sa ido."

msgid "The result sheet is endorsed 'Result Cancelled'."
msgstr "An rubuta 'Result Cancelled' a takardar sakamako."

#, python-format
msgid "%(who)s received. Waiting for INEC's IReV upload to compare."
msgstr "An karbi %(who)s. Ana jiran INEC ta dora a IReV don kwatantawa."

msgid "Waiting for result-sheet photos from this polling unit."
msgstr "Ana jiran hotunan takardar sakamako daga wannan rumfa."

msgid ""
"One upload differs from IReV. We need a second independent upload before "
"flagging a mismatch."
msgstr ""
"Hoto daya ya bambanta da IReV. Muna bukatar wani daga wani mutum kafin mu ce"
" bai yi daidai ba."

msgid "Part of the sheet was hard to read. A verifier will check it."
msgstr ""
"Wani bangare na takardar ya yi wahalar karantawa. Mai tantancewa zai duba."

msgid "The numbers on a sheet don't add up. A verifier will check it."
msgstr "Lambobin takardar ba su yi daidai ba. Mai tantancewa zai duba."

msgid "Uploads from different people don't agree. A verifier will check them."
msgstr ""
"Hotunan mutane daban-daban ba su yi daidai ba. Mai tantancewa zai duba."

msgid "A verifier needs to check this before we show a result status."
msgstr "Mai tantancewa dole ya duba kafin mu nuna matsayin sakamako."

