msgid ""
"If you're blind, visually impaired or have a disability, a person of your "
"choice can help you vote. Tell the presiding officer."
msgstr ""
"Idan kai makaho ne, ba ka gani sosai ko kana da nakasa, wanda ka zaba zai "
"iya taimaka maka ka yi zabe. Gaya wa jami'in da ke jagoranci."

msgid "Ask about priority in the queue and assistive materials."
msgstr "Tambayi fifiko a layi da kayan taimako."

msgid "Prefer talking? Use Ask in your language."
msgstr "Ka fi son magana? Yi amfani da Tambaya a harshenka."

msgid ""
"No smartphone? Dial the short code. Community leaders also get voice notes "
"to share."
msgstr ""
"Babu wayar zamani? Kira gajeren lamba. Shugabannin al'umma ma suna samun "
"sakon murya don yadawa."

