msgstr "DOLE"

msgid ""
"Nationwide collection began 9 Oct 2026, usually at your LGA INEC office."
msgstr ""
"An fara karba a fadin kasa ranar 9 ga Oktoba 2026, galibi a ofishin INEC na "
"karamar hukumarka."

msgid "Cards are usually ready 1–3 months after registration."
msgstr "Galibi katuna suna shiryawa bayan wata 1–3 da rajista."

