msgstr "MATAKI · RAJISTA"

msgid "ONLY CVR.INECNIGERIA.ORG"
msgstr "CVR.INECNIGERIA.ORG KADAI"

msgid ""
"INEC has warned about fake registration websites. Registration is free."
msgstr ""
"INEC ta yi gargadi game da shafukan rajista na bogi. Rajista kyauta ne."

msgid "Pre-register online on INEC's CVR portal"
msgstr "Fara rajista a shafin CVR na INEC"

msgid "Finish in person: fingerprints and photo at an INEC office"
msgstr "Kammala da kanka: zanen yatsa da hoto a ofishin INEC"

msgid ""
"Moved house? Transfer on the same portal. You need the VIN on your card"
msgstr ""
"Ka koma wani gida? Canja wuri a shafin guda. Kana bukatar VIN da ke kan "
"katinka"

