msgid ""
"Paste a message you received or describe what you saw. We check it against "
"other reports, verifiers and public sources."
msgstr ""
"Lika sakon da ka karba ko ka bayyana abin da ka gani. Za mu duba shi da wasu"
" rahotanni, masu tantancewa da majiyoyin jama'a."

msgid "Message or what you saw"
msgstr "Sako ko abin da ka gani"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Iri"

