msgstr "Bude zabe na"

#, python-format
msgid "Setup · step %(step)s of 3"
msgstr "Saitawa · mataki %(step)s cikin 3"

msgid "Choose your language."
msgstr "Zabi harshenka."

msgid "Used for alerts, voice and every screen."
msgstr "Za a yi amfani da shi a sanarwa, murya da kowane shafi."

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Ci gaba"

msgid "Where do you vote?"
msgstr "A ina kake yin zabe?"

msgid "Use your location, or type the code on your voter's card."
msgstr "Yi amfani da wurinka, ko ka rubuta lambar da ke kan katin zabenka."

msgid "Or type your PU code"
msgstr "Ko ka rubuta lambar PU dinka"

msgid "This is my unit"
msgstr "Wannan ce rumfata"

msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Tsallake yanzu"

msgid "Get alerts?"
msgstr "Kana son sanarwa?"

msgid ""
"If your unit moves or a result is checked, we'll tell you, even on a basic "
"phone."
msgstr ""
"Idan rumfarka ta koma ko an duba sakamako, za mu sanar da kai, ko a wayar "
"hannu ta yau da kullum."

msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Kammala"

msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "A'a na gode"

msgid "Stored encrypted. Send STOP any time."
msgstr "An ajiye a boye. Tura STOP a kowane lokaci."

msgid "ELECTION DAY"
msgstr "RANAR ZABE"

msgid "Is it open?"
msgstr "An bude?"

msgid "No reports yet. Officials check in by USSD; voters can report below."
msgstr ""
"Babu rahoto tukuna. Jami'ai suna shiga ta USSD; masu zabe za su iya ruwaito "
"a kasa."

msgid "Updated"
msgstr "An sabunta"

msgid "Are you there? Tell others"
msgstr "Kana can? Gaya wa wasu"

msgid "Crowd reports show only when at least two different people agree."
msgstr ""
"Rahoton jama'a yana bayyana ne kawai idan akalla mutane biyu daban-daban sun"
" yarda."

msgid "Check it,"
msgstr "Duba shi,"

msgid "don't forward it."
msgstr "kada ka tura shi."

msgid ""
"Compare the result sheet on the wall with INEC's upload, or check a message "
"before you share it."
msgstr ""
"Kwatanta takardar sakamako a bango da abin da INEC ta dora, ko ka duba sako "
"kafin ka yada shi."

msgid "What to check"
msgstr "Abin da za a duba"

msgid "Result sheet"
msgstr "Takardar sakamako"

msgid "Rumour"
msgstr "Jita-jita"

msgid "Paste the message you received…"
msgstr "Lika sakon da ka karba…"

