msgstr "Jam'iyya"

msgid "Wall"
msgstr "Bango"

msgid "Full details"
msgstr "Cikakken bayani"

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Yadda yake aiki"

msgid "After counting, the result sheet (Form EC8A) is posted on the wall"
msgstr "Bayan kirga, ana lika takardar sakamako (Form EC8A) a bango"

msgid "Photograph it here. It works offline"
msgstr "Dauki hotonta a nan. Yana aiki ba tare da intanet ba"

