msgstr "Za ka sami Ya yi daidai ko Bai yi daidai ba, tare da dalilai"

msgid "See an example"
msgstr "Duba misali"

msgid "Photograph a result sheet"
msgstr "Dauki hoton takardar sakamako"

msgid ""
"Take a clear photo of Form EC8A on the wall. Works offline: it's saved on "
"your phone and sent when you have signal."
msgstr ""
